## Original Content
Última hora sobre la crisis migratoria en Ceuta y la declaración de 'situación de interés para la seguridad nacional' en la ciudad autónoma.

## Summary
The article discusses the ongoing migratory crisis in Ceuta, where Robles has apologized to residents for feelings of abandonment and asserted that Ceuta and Melilla are untouchable. A situation of national security interest has been declared in the autonomous city.

## Key Points
- Robles apologizes to Ceutíes who felt abandoned.
- Ceuta and Melilla are declared untouchable.
- The migratory crisis in Ceuta is ongoing.
- A situation of interest for national security is declared in Ceuta.


